WEBVTT

00:08:58.836 --> 00:09:02.676
the very principles which binds
humanity together.

00:09:04.196 --> 00:09:07.236
Over the years, my obsession for beauty,

00:09:08.076 --> 00:09:09.756
it's led me to this truth:

00:09:10.916 --> 00:09:13.436
you cannot appreciate beauty

00:09:13.436 --> 00:09:16.036
if you cannot recognize it in yourself.

00:09:17.196 --> 00:09:20.436
So how do we change
our perceptions of beauty?

00:09:21.636 --> 00:09:24.236
We have to get real with ourselves

00:09:24.276 --> 00:09:27.196
and start by asking: Who am I?

00:09:27.876 --> 00:09:29.596
Where do I come from?

00:09:29.636 --> 00:09:31.996
The world that I live in --
how did it come to be?